{"version":1,"content":"<p>Pocketpair行政總裁溝部拓郎近日在接受VGC採訪時表示，如果未來有機會與任天堂討論《幻獸帕魯》登陸Switch平台，工作室「很樂意進行這樣的對話」。他稱，Switch 2不僅是全球遊戲市場的重要平台，對日本遊戲產業尤其意義重大。不過，Pocketpair尚未宣佈開發Switch 2版，也沒有確認雙方已經展開相關談判。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/game/1584168.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-10-28T09:02:08.162246+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":168,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-28T08:45:33+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-28T08:58:15.396774+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-28T08:58:15.396774+00:00","content_hash":"07a00396f81fb5cab660be5e9059643bc196baef1f0ae8e8879403b0539d97a6","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}